stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Practice
  Practice --> Warmup: scheduled tournament begins
  Warmup --> Tournament: confirmed level transition
  Tournament --> NextRound: round deadline and results finalized
  NextRound --> Warmup: next round has warmup
  NextRound --> Tournament: next round starts directly
  Tournament --> Completed: final round ends
  Practice --> Retired: event cancelled or room closes
  Warmup --> Retired: event cancelled or room closes
  Tournament --> Retired: event cancelled or room closes
  Completed --> [*]
  Retired --> [*]
